A minimalistic aerial view of a pristine white desk surface with a single document represented as a clean paper airplane in mid-flight, casting a long dramatic shadow. The airplane trails a thin, elegant red thread that connects to a small circular pin on a simplified map fragment in the corner. The composition uses stark negative space, muted cream and soft gray tones with that single accent of vermillion red. The paper airplane is captured at a dynamic angle suggesting purposeful movement and direction, embodying intention and destination rather than mere transmission.
